---
import SectionAmbience from "@/components/ui/SectionAmbience.astro";
import SurfaceCard from "@/components/ui/SurfaceCard.astro";
import IllustrationShell from "@/components/ui/IllustrationShell.astro";
---

<section id="company" class="relative overflow-hidden py-16 lg:py-24">
  <SectionAmbience />

  <div class="relative z-10 container mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p
          id="company-eyebrow"
          class="section-eyebrow mb-6 translate-y-4 text-primary opacity-0 font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-sm"
        >
          Visión
        </p>

        <h2
          id="company-headline"
          class="headline-editorial text-3xl leading-[1.15] text-foreground opacity-0 translate-y-4 sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold"
        >
          En Liiot, no construimos software, diseñamos soluciones de alto
          impacto en el{" "}
          <span class="text-gradient pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em]"
            >bienestar humano.</span
          >
        </h2>

        <div
          class="mt-10 max-w-prose space-y-6 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground lg:text-lg"
        >
          <div id="company-p1" class="opacity-0 translate-y-4">
            <p>
              Existimos para erradicar lo aburrido y hostil—términos cuyo
              propósito es frenar el crecimiento de las empresas.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div id="company-p2" class="opacity-0 translate-y-4">
            <p>
              ¿Cómo lo hacemos? Mediante herramientas que fusionan el poder
              digital con la facilidad de uso, donde el resultado directo se
              traduce en bienestar humano.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div id="company-p3" class="opacity-0 translate-y-4">
            <p class="border-l-2 border-primary/35 pl-4">
              Potenciamos las habilidades de las personas eliminando lo tedioso,
              porque estamos convencidos de que una empresa que cuida el tiempo
              de su gente y su calidad de vida es una empresa destinada al <span
                class="font-semibold text-gradient">éxito.</span
              >
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hidden lg:col-span-5 lg:flex lg:justify-center">
        <SurfaceCard
          class="group/well relative flex h-[min(400px,54vh)] w-full max-w-md flex-col justify-center p-6 transition-shadow duration-700 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-primary/5"
          tone="brand"
        >
          <IllustrationShell
            title="Bienestar operativo"
            class="mx-auto flex h-full w-full max-w-[320px] flex-col items-center justify-end overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-background/40 p-4 relative"
          >
            <div
              class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#80808012_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#80808012_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:20px_20px] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_60%_at_50%_50%,#000_10%,transparent_100%)]"
            >
            </div>

            <div
              class="absolute top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-20 flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 bg-muted/30 p-1 backdrop-blur-sm"
            >
              <span
                class="relative z-10 px-3 py-1 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground transition-colors duration-500 group-hover/well:text-muted-foreground/50"
                >Antes</span
              >
              <span
                class="relative z-10 px-3 py-1 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground/50 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover/well:text-chart-5"
                >Después</span
              >
              <div
                class="absolute left-1 top-1 h-[calc(100%-8px)] w-[calc(50%-4px)] rounded-full bg-background shadow-sm transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover/well:translate-x-full"
              >
              </div>
            </div>

            <div
              class="absolute right-4 top-14 z-20 flex translate-y-2 scale-95 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-accent/30 bg-card/95 px-2.5 py-1.5 opacity-0 shadow-lg backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover/well:translate-y-0 group-hover/well:scale-100 group-hover/well:opacity-100 delay-300"
            >
              <svg
                class="size-3 text-accent"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2.5"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
              </svg>
              <span
                class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-foreground"
                >Costos Extra</span
              >
            </div>

            <div
              class="relative flex h-[200px] w-full items-end justify-center gap-6 px-4 pb-6 z-10"
            >
              <div
                class="absolute top-[40%] left-2 right-2 flex items-center gap-2 z-0"
              >
                <div
                  class="h-[1px] w-full border-t border-dashed border-primary/30"
                >
                </div>
                <span class="text-[9px] font-black text-primary/70">40h</span>
              </div>

              <div
                class="group/bar relative flex w-10 flex-col items-center justify-end h-[95%] transition-all duration-700 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover/well:h-[55%]"
              >
                <div
                  class="absolute -top-7 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover/well:opacity-0"
                >
                  <span
                    class="rounded bg-destructive/15 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-bold text-destructive shadow-sm"
                    >62h</span
                  >
                </div>
                <div
                  class="absolute -top-7 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 delay-150 group-hover/well:opacity-100"
                >
                  <span
                    class="rounded bg-chart-5/15 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-bold text-chart-5 shadow-sm"
                    >38h</span
                  >
                </div>

                <div
                  class="w-full rounded-t-md border-t-2 border-x-2 border-destructive bg-destructive/60 transition-colors duration-700 group-hover/well:border-chart-5/60 group-hover/well:bg-chart-5/30 h-full"
                >
                </div>
                <span
                  class="absolute -bottom-5 whitespace-nowrap text-[9px] font-bold text-muted-foreground"
                  >Equipo A</span
                >
              </div>

              <div
                class="group/bar relative flex w-10 flex-col items-center justify-end h-[80%] transition-all duration-700 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover/well:h-[48%] delay-75"
              >
                <div
                  class="absolute -top-7 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover/well:opacity-0"
                >
                  <span
                    class="rounded bg-destructive/15 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-bold text-destructive shadow-sm"
                    >54h</span
                  >
                </div>
                <div
                  class="absolute -top-7 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 delay-150 group-hover/well:opacity-100"
                >
                  <span
                    class="rounded bg-primary/15 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-bold text-primary shadow-sm"
                    >36h</span
                  >
                </div>

                <div
                  class="w-full rounded-t-md border-t-2 border-x-2 border-destructive/80 bg-destructive/50 transition-colors duration-700 group-hover/well:border-primary/60 group-hover/well:bg-primary/30 h-full"
                >
                </div>
                <span
                  class="absolute -bottom-5 whitespace-nowrap text-[9px] font-bold text-muted-foreground"
                  >Equipo B</span
                >
              </div>

              <div
                class="group/bar relative flex w-10 flex-col items-center justify-end h-[42%] transition-all duration-700 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] delay-100"
              >
                <div class="absolute -top-7">
                  <span
                    class="rounded bg-accent/15 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-bold text-accent shadow-sm"
                    >32h</span
                  >
                </div>
                <div
                  class="w-full rounded-t-md border-t-2 border-x-2 border-accent/60 bg-accent/30 h-full"
                >
                </div>
                <span
                  class="absolute -bottom-5 whitespace-nowrap text-[9px] font-bold text-muted-foreground"
                  >Equipo C</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>

            <div
              class="absolute bottom-[44px] left-4 right-4 h-px bg-border z-0"
            >
            </div>
          </IllustrationShell>
        </SurfaceCard>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
